{"title":"1994 AHSME Problems/Problem 9","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/b/1/7b1ac662f7ddbbce489953c8b7693848239564aa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"28\" height=\"14\" /> is four times <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/9/1/2918f7d23f9ee8c04baabad86100d68023ec03f9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle B$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"29\" height=\"14\" />, and the complement of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/9/1/2918f7d23f9ee8c04baabad86100d68023ec03f9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle B$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"29\" height=\"14\" /> is four times the complement of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/b/1/7b1ac662f7ddbbce489953c8b7693848239564aa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"28\" height=\"14\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/e/1/0e10bd524fa4d0307fc3d6bc76df6d69d2f00f29.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle B=$\" width=\"46\" height=\"12\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/0/f/c0f5709c2d4bd036dee9450cfbe0bf00b57f0807.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 10^{\\circ} \\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ 12^{\\circ} \\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ 15^{\\circ} \\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ 18^{\\circ} \\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ 22.5^{\\circ}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"445\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/8/6/5865a9a81df0ab0c4a7b33b4e6ae99431597238d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle A=x$\" width=\"60\" height=\"13\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/2/1/62193cc4de113712a7a023080b9ff8e704964145.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle B=y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"61\" height=\"16\" />. From the first condition, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/1/0/c10356247a9cf320babd089b9622ef15239c5aa3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=4y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"52\" height=\"15\" />. From the second condition, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/6/7/767d755dce7d34e9b99fd13f186c18ff190ff5dd.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[90-y=4(90-x).\\]\" width=\"151\" height=\"18\" /> Substituting <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/1/0/c10356247a9cf320babd089b9622ef15239c5aa3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=4y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"52\" height=\"15\" /> into the previous equation and solving yields <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/2/1/32103000ddd416612499e125c4ca9e420c587d74.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*}90-y=4(90-4y)&amp;\\implies 90-y=360-16y\\\\&amp;\\implies 15y=270\\\\&amp;\\implies y=\\boxed{\\textbf{(D) }18^\\circ.}\\end{align*}\" width=\"356\" height=\"79\" />\n</p><p>--Solution by <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=200685\">TheMaskedMagician</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AHSME\" title=\"1994 AHSME\">1994 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1994 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1994 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1994\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1994 AHSME Problems/Problem 8\">Problem 8</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AHSME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1994 AHSME Problems/Problem 10\">Problem 10</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1994 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1994 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1994 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1994 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1994 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1994 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1994 AHSME Problems